{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>下周一是世界愛滋病日，衞生署一連兩日舉辦活動響應。</p><p></p><p>全球同抗愛滋病運動在觀塘海濱舉行，衞生署署長林文健等出席啟動禮。活動設戶外藝術展覽，署方期望透過藝術裝置、互動教育展板、手作工作坊等，讓公眾認識治療愛滋病發展及預防資訊等。</p><p></p><p>展覽一連兩日，由中午12時至晚上8時，免費入場。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:03:46.152100+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T05:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T06:28:03.786453+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T05:57:14.011205+00:00","content_hash":"dda3cfcd44932a98d8a24bc3268e95dcef7f65ba19c67cfe3420b7e936b761a7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:03:46.152100+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}